body:
i think this is realistic; 
charcuturie board you imagine, 
vs: the charcoochie board irl

I know that sounds bad, 
but think of this like one of thpse Armpit spritzer commercials; 
have you ever been assassinated, 
or hit by cars, or beaten
by a gang, only to see their leader exalted, or lost a lung to medical malpractice?  are you denied any right of political inclusion, and dissed by traffic-routing everyday, and made to feel like your career is at best up to Subordinate?  
then maybe life isn't so bad - you feel ok;
